Changes.   29 Sep 1999
========

'utils/UserLast.rexx'
----------------------
  Check in section "Plant:" for non-existent user record.  A guest
caller who didn't join the BBS will not have a user record to
write 'lastcall'.

  Current date is written to user recxord, line 9, as _six_ digits
and not 8. (8 digits confuses Transamiga.)


